  "ingredients": [
    "5 large potatoes",
    "0.375 cup butter",
    "2 tablespoons minced onion",
    "2 teaspoons dried parsley",
    "2 teaspoons salt",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground black pepper",
    "1 (16 ounce) container sour cream",
    "1.5 cups milk",
    "1 cup shredded processed cheese"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wDXLdbjYzZjUGQeCLI1eU-tpzw8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15012-delmonico-potatoes-VAT-005-step-01-c82390f52eac4eb790559522a4d773a1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15012/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring a large pot of salted water to a boil. Cook potatoes in boiling water until tender, 8 to 10 minutes. Refrigerate potatoes for 8 hours to overnight.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/OBMuMEYCGz8ScjX5_Lkz6JoEsLc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15012-delmonico-potatoes-VAT-006-step-02-9b20914a9a17492ea2e331d907aa43e1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15012/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease a 9x13-inch casserole dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/a1tY1UT_wGbK8gKcvOPD93_YZpo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15012-delmonico-potatoes-VAT-007-step-03-c20bdda4bf99458fb11c3460d788b93a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15012/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grate cooked potatoes into a large bowl. Combine melted butter, onion, parsley, salt, and pepper in a small bowl. In a separate small bowl, mix sour cream and milk.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/IdXHt6ZacZqJ2HuLsYBImUowRxA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15012-delmonico-potatoes-VAT-008-step-04-7cd8df1c01f2486987641a6aa93b137a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15012/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Layer 1/2 of the potatoes into the bottom of the prepared casserole dish. Sprinkle with 1/2 of the butter and onion mixture. Pour 1/2 of the sour cream mixture over the top; cover with 1/2 cup shredded cheese. Repeat with remaining ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JnrQ41qGo4XMmSiqrwoaOGpIpfw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15012-delmonico-potatoes-VAT-009-step-05-0b221739ecbc4d36995dab37ab743696.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15012/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake casserole in the preheated oven until cheese on top is lightly browned, about 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/85xrQ-Vr39j9D7PnSzkzle9FBWQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15012-delmonico-potatoes-VAT-010-step-06-b2d5830c401e4342a147c38a95041954.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15012/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve hot and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WOVE73kd1GVyh6m94OWZ9FBBZDM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15012-delmonico-potatoes-VAT-011-step-07-d3a07f35c0894a56b9cb1d21a8d5e72d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15012/step_07.webp"
    }
